USED RIGHT: ADVANCED MARKETPLACE FEATURES, VENDOR MANAGEMENT AND PREMIUM UI REFINEMENT

1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack web developer, senior UI/UX designer, senior product designer, e-commerce marketplace architect and professional design systems engineer.

You are working on the existing UsedRight marketplace project.

Your job is to implement the following improvements while preserving all existing working features.

Think like a senior developer building a serious international e-commerce company.

IMPORTANT DEVELOPMENT RULES:

* Inspect the existing application before making changes.
* Do not rebuild the project from scratch.
* Do not remove existing working functionality.
* Do not replace functional features with static designs.
* Preserve existing routes, components, database structures and business logic where possible.
* Integrate new features into the existing architecture.
* Make all new features interactive in demo mode.
* Avoid unnecessary complexity.
* Use reusable components and maintainable code.
* Test every new workflow.

The most important objectives are simplicity, transparency, premium design, mobile-first usability and efficient marketplace operations.

